  "@viewer.kind.pdf": {
    "sourceHash": "1d393b0",
    "sameAsSourceJustification": "Format name \"PDF\", kept Latin in every Traditional Chinese source: Apple writes `PDF文件` and `PDF` bare across zh-TW and zh-HK, and Microsoft zh-Hant keeps it too. The word names an ISO standard, so translating it would break recognition. Its sibling kinds (`viewer.kind.image`, `viewer.kind.text`) ARE translated, which is why this one stands out."
  },
